  [2m 5[0m  [1;31m✗[0m missing '=' after key
        [1;31merror[0m [2m·[0m EG007 syntax-error [2m·[0m .env.production:10:8

      [1mWhy[0m      Env loaders skip or misread malformed lines, so the affected variable silently ends
               up with a wrong value or none at all.
      [1mFix[0m      1. Write assignments as KEY=value.
               2. Keys cannot contain spaces, and a bare 'export KEY' without a value is not
                  supported.

