        [1;33mwarning[0m [2m·[0m EG006 duplicate-key [2m·[0m .env.production:8:1

      [1mWhy[0m      Most loaders (dotenv, python-dotenv, Docker) silently use the last definition, so
               editing the first one has no effect and the file says two different things.
      [1mFix[0m      Keep one definition of DEBUG in .env.production: delete line 8 or the earlier one at
               line 7, keeping the value you intend.
